+
+RESULT
+tools.klean_preflight.KleanPreflightError:
+lake build failed (1):
+info: stderr:
+error: failed to locate application
+error: Lean exited with code 1
+Some required builds logged failures:
+- Klean4MeanAbsoluteDeviation.Prelude
+error: build failed
+
+Independent direct probe:
+
+  /opt/elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4---v4.22.0/bin/lean --version
+
